rd's needles follow the new spellings and are probed. The control structure's keel_commands_in reads a routed sub-verb so a hook's data names `gate validate`, not `gate`. hardening reads dispatched 39/39. The commit passes its own rewritten pre-commit hook and its own rewritten CI. Decisions and .tracking are not rewritten; ledger ids validate, check-engine and guard are kept as ids."; }
